  "description": "Facing 'Death' for the one I love is something I would do without hesitation, but this isn't right. I didn't live until today only to die for the one I love. I longed to look into your blue eyes, but you only looked down on me and turned away. I was chosen that very day to be the 'Alice' who would breathe her last breath to save your love, 'Heart'.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list.nhn?titleId=614560)  \nOfficial English Translation\n\n*Note :This webtoon was the remade version of series published in 2012 on Naver Best Challenge and Tapas. *",
